{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "95b10df6-1ff5-8f78-8151-d61ee682baa8",
  "created_at": "2026-01-11T12:38:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Paulo Cabral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:34:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:34:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin. Yes, good afternoon. I know City Hall is closed today, Sunday, so I call the storm line. Is okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:34:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you got the right place. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:34:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am calling about water on the street. After the storm yesterday, the coastal storm, the water is still sitting there. It is across the crosswalk, near the school bus stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:34:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, and where's this at? What's the address or the nearest corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:34:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eighteen Ruggles Avenue. Up on the Historic Hill. The bus stop is just down from my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:35:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eighteen Ruggles, got it. So the water's pooled right across the crosswalk, you said."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:35:11-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, all across. Is wide, maybe the whole crosswalk. Children wait there in the morning for bus. Now the water is too deep for walk on the edge, so they step into the road to go around. Cars come. I worry very much somebody get hit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:35:30-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's not good. Okay, I'm writing down, water across crosswalk at the bus stop, kids stepping out into the street. Is the drain right there clogged, do you know, or can you see it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:35:45-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see a drain, but I think is full of leaves and sand from the storm. Water does not go down. Also, um, there is a manhole cover near it. It look off by one inch, maybe. Not sitting flat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:36:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Off by an inch, like it's sitting higher on one side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:36:06-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, higher on one side. A car go over, it make a sound. [pause] Sorry, my phone, it feels heavier than it used to. I am holding it in one hand and pointing with the other, like a crazy man."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:36:22-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, I do the same thing. Okay, so the manhole cover I'll note separate, shifted a little, near the drain by the crosswalk. Somebody should look at that so a plow or a car doesn't catch it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:36:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Thank you. The kids, they go to school Monday morning. That is tomorrow. I am worried the water still there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:36:47-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'm marking this one as a priority because of the bus stop. Let me make sure I have it right. Eighteen Ruggles Avenue, crosswalk at the bus stop flooded, drain likely blocked with debris, and a manhole cover sitting a bit off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:37:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. That is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:37:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. You want a call back when somebody's been out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:37:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. My number is four zero one, five five five, zero one seven eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:37:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-eight. And can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:37:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Paulo Cabral. C-A-B-R-A-L."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:37:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Mr. Cabral."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:37:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Kevin, I want to ask. Do the crews work on weekends? Because it is Sunday, and I think maybe nobody come until Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:37:38-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They do get called out on weekends after a storm, especially for stuff like this. I'll send it to the on-call supervisor right now, and with the school stop involved it should get looked at ahead of the routine stuff. Most likely today or first thing tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:37:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That is good. Tomorrow morning is the important time, for the bus."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:38:03-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. If it's still bad in the morning, call this line again and tell them it's the Ruggles Avenue bus stop. And if a kid's in immediate danger in the road, that's a police call, not us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:38:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I understand. I will watch from the window. Thank you very much for your help, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:38:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Mr. Cabral. You take care, and enjoy the rest of your Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T12:38:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
